Error [jet.InvalidMapKeyType]: `[Int]` can't be a map key type
  --> tests/ui/module_global_map_key_refusals.jet:4:19
    |
  4 | by_path: fn() -> [[Int]: String] {
    |                   ^^^^^
 Why: Map keys must be Int, String, Bool, Char, U8/IntN, a payload-free enum, or a tuple/struct whose fields recursively follow these rules; Float, views, Shared, functions, lists, maps, sets, and payload-carrying enums are not key-eligible
 Fix: Use an eligible scalar, enum, tuple, or struct key; remove non-key fields or store the value separately
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0502

